B.ET=s([0,1,6,2,6,3],t.t)
B.Dv=new A.cD(3,"Stop the row","A horizontal three has two ends. If one end is already blocked, only one square matters \u2014 find it before you look anywhere else.",B.ff,B.ET,4,B.ak,"The teal diamonds hold columns 2, 3 and 4 on the bottom row. The left end, column 1, is already yours. That leaves column 5 as the only square that finishes their row, so that is the only move.")
