B.DY=s([3,0],t.t)
B.Dt=new A.cD(4,"The middle is worth more","A piece in the centre belongs to more possible fours than a piece on the edge \u2014 more rows, more diagonals. Nothing in the rules says so; it falls out of the shape of the board. Count them and see.",B.Df,B.DY,3,B.ak,"Thirteen different fours pass through the square you just took, more than through any other square available this turn. An edge square sits on far fewer. That single fact is why strong players open in the middle and fight for it afterwards.")
