B.DZ=s([3,3,2,4],t.t)
B.Di=new A.cD(13,"Count the empty squares","The board holds 42 squares. If you move first you take squares 1, 3, 5 and so on, so on a full board you take the odd ones. Whose turn it is when a key square opens is not luck; it is arithmetic.",B.dL,B.DZ,null,B.ak,"When you find a square that decides the game, count how many empty squares sit below it in that column. That tells you who will be on move when it opens \u2014 and therefore whether the threat is yours or theirs.")
